        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "id-ad-ocsp is also known as id-pkix-ocsp. The OID repository [99] also refers to id-ad-ocsp as ocsp(1) (see NOTE 1 in this subclause providing the OID value for id-ad-ocsp).",
