        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The OID for \"ecdsa-with-SHA512\" is defined as { iso(1) member-body(2) us(840) ansi-X9-62(10045) signatures(4) ecdsa-with-SHA2(3) 4 } in ASN.1 notation (refer to ITU-T X.680 for details of ASN.1 notation).",
